            InkProfile(true,"hands","通常攻撃が4回命中するごとに、命中地点から2m以内にいる、ボス以外で行動妨害が効く敵を最大1m引き寄せる。0.35秒後に、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の20%の掌打ダメージを与える。再発動まで4秒かかる。地形は通過せず、自身も動かない。", "Every 4 basic attack hits, pull enemies within 2m of the hit location up to 1m, excluding bosses and enemies immune to crowd control. After 0.35 seconds, deal palm-strike damage equal to 20% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Cooldown: 4 seconds. Enemies cannot pass through terrain, and you do not move.", "通常攻击每命中4次，将命中地点2m以内的敌人拉近最多1m，首领和免疫控制的敌人除外。0.35秒后造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方20%的掌击伤害。冷却4秒。敌人无法穿过地形，自身也不会移动。",new[]{InkChannel("LotusInch",BossInkBalance.LotusInchValue)},
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.EnemyMovement,BossPayload.Pull,anchor:BossAnchor.Hit,radiusMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA0RadiusMilli,magnitudeMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA0MagnitudeMilli,element:BossElement.Light),
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LotusInch",anchor:BossAnchor.Hit,cooldownMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA1CooldownMillis,delayMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA1DelayMillis,mainHits:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA1MainHits,maxInstances:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA1MaxInstances,radiusMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteHandsA1RadiusMilli,element:BossElement.Light)),
            InkProfile(true,"feet","移動が終わってから2秒以内に行う次の通常攻撃が命中したとき、到達地点から命中方向へ長さ6m・幅1mの直線状に、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の20%のダメージを与える。再発動まで4秒かかる。", "When your next basic attack within 2 seconds after movement ends hits, deal damage from your arrival location toward the hit direction along a line 6m long and 1m wide, equal to 20% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Cooldown: 4 seconds.", "移动结束后2秒内的下一次通常攻击命中时，从到达地点向命中方向沿长6m、宽1m的直线造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方20%的伤害。冷却4秒。",new[]{InkChannel("LotusArrival",BossInkBalance.LotusArrivalValue)},
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MovementCompleted,BossMechanism.Ledger,BossPayload.ArrivalWindow,lifetimeMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteFeetA0LifetimeMillis),
