            InkProfile(true,"stage2","通常攻撃が3回命中するごとに、自身の位置に半径3mの白蓮領域を展開し、0.75秒後に攻撃力・魔力の高い方の40%の掌打ダメージを与える。掌打の後も領域は2秒間続き、領域内にいる自身と最も近い味方ヒーロー1人は、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の15%の障壁を2秒間得る。障壁はそれぞれ1回までで、再発動まで4秒かかる。領域は同時に1つまで存在できる。", "Every 3 basic attack hits, create a White Lotus area with a 3m radius at your position. After 0.75 seconds, deal palm-strike damage equal to 40% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. The area then lasts 2 seconds and grants you and the nearest allied hero inside a shield once each, lasting 2 seconds and equal to 15%. Cooldown: 4 seconds. Only one area can exist at once.", "通常攻击每命中3次，在自身位置展开半径3m的白莲领域，0.75秒后造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方40%的掌击伤害。掌击后领域继续存在2秒，范围内的自身及最近的1名友方英雄各获得1次相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方15%的护盾，持续2秒。冷却4秒。同时最多存在1个领域。",new[]{InkChannel("LotusDomainPalm",BossInkBalance.LotusDomainPalmValue),InkChannel("LotusDomainShield",BossInkBalance.LotusDomainShieldValue,kind:BossCoefficientKind.Shield)},
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LotusDomainPalm",cooldownMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0CooldownMillis,delayMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0DelayMillis,lifetimeMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0LifetimeMillis,mainHits:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0MainHits,maxInstances:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0MaxInstances,radiusMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A0RadiusMilli,element:BossElement.Light),
                new BossAction(BossEvent.Clock,BossMechanism.Defense,BossPayload.Shield,"LotusDomainShield",lifetimeMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A1LifetimeMillis,maxTargets:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A1MaxTargets,radiusMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A1RadiusMilli,magnitudeMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage2A1MagnitudeMilli)),
            InkProfile(true,"stage3","掌打が発動済みの自身の領域内にいるときに通常攻撃が命中すると、命中方向へ範囲6m・角度90°の波を放ち、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の30%のダメージを与える。再発動まで2秒かかる。予告中の領域と、この攻撃で新しく生成された領域は対象にならない。", "When your basic attack hits while you are inside your own area where the palm strike has already occurred, release a wave toward the hit direction in a fan with a 6m range and a 90-degree angle, dealing 30% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power. Cooldown: 2 seconds. Areas still showing a warning, or created by this attack, do not qualify.", "自身位于已经发动掌击的己方领域内时，通常攻击命中会向命中方向释放射程6m、角度90°的扇形波，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方30%的伤害。冷却2秒。仍在预警中的领域和本次攻击新生成的领域不符合条件。",new[]{InkChannel("LotusDomainWave",BossInkBalance.LotusDomainWaveValue)},
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LotusDomainWave",BossShape.Fan,cooldownMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage3A0CooldownMillis,rangeMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage3A0RangeMilli,angleMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage3A0AngleMilli,element:BossElement.Light)),
            InkProfile(true,"stage6","同じ掌打発動済みの領域内にいるときに通常攻撃が3回命中すると、領域を消費して半径5mに境界波を放ち、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の90%（上限100%）のダメージを与える。命中の回数は波の再発動待ちの間も数える。さらに元の領域内にいたヒーロー最大2人に、攻撃力・魔力の高い方の38%（上限40%）の障壁を2秒間付与する。再発動まで6秒かかる。白夜セットの障壁は最大値で上書きされ、上限は攻撃力・魔力の高い方の38%である。", "After 3 basic attack hits while you are inside the same area where the palm strike has already occurred, consume it to release a boundary wave in a 5m radius, dealing 90% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power (cap: 100%). Hits during the wave cooldown also count. Also grant up to 2 heroes who were inside the original area a shield for 2 seconds equal to 38% (cap: 40%). Cooldown: 6 seconds. White Night set shields replace one another with the highest value, capped at 38% of whichever is higher: your Attack or Ability Power.", "自身位于同一个已发动掌击的领域内时，通常攻击命中3次会消耗领域，向半径5m释放边界波，造成相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方90%（上限100%）的伤害。波的冷却期间也会累计命中次数。此外为原领域内最多2名英雄施加相当于攻击力与法术强度中较高一方38%（上限40%）的护盾，持续2秒。冷却6秒。白夜套装的护盾以最高值覆盖，上限为攻击力与法术强度中较高一方的38%。",new[]{InkChannel("LotusBoundary",BossInkBalance.LotusBoundaryValue,BossInkBalance.LotusBoundaryCap),InkChannel("LotusBoundaryShield",BossInkBalance.LotusBoundaryShieldValue,BossInkBalance.LotusBoundaryShieldCap,BossCoefficientKind.Shield)},
                new BossAction(BossEvent.MainHit,BossMechanism.ShapeAttack,BossPayload.Damage,"LotusBoundary",cooldownMillis:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage6A0CooldownMillis,mainHits:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage6A0MainHits,radiusMilli:BossInkBalance.WhiteStage6A0RadiusMilli,element:BossElement.Light),
